```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Background Image Display</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            height: 100vh;
            width: 100vw;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            overflow-y: hidden;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
